Status Indicators in Rich
Rich provides a Status context manager that shows a spinner with a message while a task is running. This is perfect for long operations where you want to reassure the user that something is happening.


from rich.console import Console
import time

console = Console()

# Show a spinner with a message
with console.status("[bold green]Processing data..."):
    # Simulate a long-running task
    for i in range(5):
        time.sleep(1)
        console.log(f"Step {i+1} completed")
